sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant CK as Checkout.jsx
  participant BE as POST /api/orders
  participant OO as order_ops.py
  participant DB as SQLite
  participant ML as mailer.py
  U->>CK: pick address, email, payment method, review
  opt new address
    CK->>BE: POST /addresses (saved to the address book)
  end
  CK->>BE: items (id and qty), address, method, couponCode, email
  BE->>OO: expire_stale_orders() frees abandoned unpaid orders
  BE->>BE: re-validate the coupon with the same rules as the offers list
  BE->>BE: pre-check stock for a friendly message
  BE->>BE: calc_totals using SERVER prices
  BE->>OO: reserve_stock(): UPDATE ... WHERE stock >= qty (atomic)
  alt not enough stock
    OO-->>BE: OutOfStock
    BE->>DB: ROLLBACK, no half-created order
    BE-->>CK: 409 sold out
  else stock reserved
    BE->>DB: COMMIT order and items
    alt cash on delivery
      BE->>ML: confirmation email as a background task
      BE-->>CK: 201 order (payment_status cod)
      CK->>CK: clear cart, open the order page
    else online UPI or card
      BE-->>CK: 201 order (payment_status pending, no email yet)
      Note over CK: Continue with the payment flow
    end
  end
